  "title": "The Blood Vessels Finer Than a Hair",
  "air_date": "2026-11-15",
  "spoken": "Harvey never saw the last link. He proved your blood goes round, but not how it crosses from arteries to veins. He died in sixteen fifty-seven, still guessing. Four years later, Marcello Malpighi put a frog's lung under a microscope. There it was: a net of vessels finer than hairs. Capillaries. The last link Harvey never saw.",
